homelab-blackbox-exporter (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * http_public: accept 404 as reachable-over-TLS. Several public vhosts
    (api, login, invite, blockemail) serve only on sub-paths and 404 on
    `/` by design; a down upstream returns 502/503 (not accepted), so real
    outages still fail. Keeps full availability + cert-expiry coverage.

